        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value8" xlink:to="footnote8" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="8" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">The value of this gas is based on the current month cash-out price provided for in our tariff. This footnote applies to all periods within the quarter.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value9" xlink:to="footnote9" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote10" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p class="Standard" style="tab-stops: 239.25pt;">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt;">Shipper supplied gas and gas lost and unaccounted for are not directly charged to an account. As directed under FERC Order No. 581, we record "Other Regulatory Assets/Liabilities" (Accounts 182.3 / 254) through offsetting entries booked to "Regulatory Debits/Credits", (Accounts 407.3/.4) for any excess or deficiency in net shipper supplied gas (Line 37). This footnote applies to Lines 6 and 28 for all periods within the quarter.<xhtml:span style="mso-tab-count: 1;"></xhtml:span></xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
